<body>
<header class="site-header">
  <div class="wrap">
    <a class="brand" href="/zh-cn/">LayerPorter</a>
    <div class="site-header-right">
      <nav class="site-nav" aria-label="Main">
        <a href="/convert/">在线工具</a>
        <a href="/zh-cn/extensions/" aria-current="page">扩展程序</a>
        <a href="/guides/">指南</a>
      </nav>
      <details class="extensions-locale-menu">
        <summary aria-label="选择语言">简体中文 <b>(ZH)</b></summary>
        <nav class="extensions-locale-options" aria-label="选择语言">
        <a href="/extensions/" lang="en" hreflang="en">English <b>(EN)</b></a>
        <a href="/ru/extensions/" lang="ru" hreflang="ru">Русский <b>(RU)</b></a>
        <a href="/de/extensions/" lang="de" hreflang="de">Deutsch <b>(DE)</b></a>
        <a href="/es/extensions/" lang="es" hreflang="es">Español <b>(ES)</b></a>
        <a href="/fr/extensions/" lang="fr" hreflang="fr">Français <b>(FR)</b></a>
        <a href="/pt-br/extensions/" lang="pt-BR" hreflang="pt-BR">Português <b>(PT)</b></a>
        <a href="/ja/extensions/" lang="ja" hreflang="ja">日本語 <b>(JA)</b></a>
        <a href="/zh-cn/extensions/" lang="zh-CN" hreflang="zh-CN" aria-current="page">简体中文 <b>(ZH)</b></a>
        </nav>
      </details>
      <span class="local-pill"><span class="local-pill-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span> 本地处理</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>
<main class="wrap">
<div class="extensions-hub">
<section class="extensions-hero">
  <span class="extensions-kicker">Chrome 扩展程序</span>
  <h1>用于下载和转换图片的 Chrome 扩展程序</h1>
  <p>两个用途明确的工具。下载 Pinterest 媒体，或从网站或电脑选择图片并保存为所需格式。</p>
</section>
<section class="extensions-grid" aria-label="Chrome 扩展程序">
<article class="extension-product">
  <div class="extension-product-visual pinterest" aria-label="Pinterest 下载">
    <div class="ux-window">
      <div class="ux-window-head">
        <div class="ux-dots" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
        <div class="ux-url">pinterest.com / board / references</div>
        <div class="ux-extension-icon"><img src="/pinterest-downloader/icon-128.png" alt="" width="21" height="21" decoding="async" /></div>
      </div>
      <div class="pd-workspace">
        <div class="pd-page">
          <div class="pd-page-head"><b>Pinterest</b><span>画板</span></div>
          <div class="pd-pins">
            <div class="pd-pin tall"><img src="/images/home/fashion-reference-320.webp" srcset="/images/home/fashion-reference-320.webp 320w, /images/home/fashion-reference-640.webp 640w" sizes="110px" alt="" width="320" height="443" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><span class="pd-pin-action">↓</span></div>
            <div class="pd-pin"><img src="/images/home/travel-reference-320.webp" srcset="/images/home/travel-reference-320.webp 320w, /images/home/travel-reference-640.webp 640w" sizes="110px" alt="" width="320" height="213" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><span class="pd-pin-action">↓</span></div>
            <div class="pd-pin"><img src="/images/home/workspace-reference-320.webp" srcset="/images/home/workspace-reference-320.webp 320w, /images/home/workspace-reference-640.webp 640w" sizes="110px" alt="" width="320" height="214" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><span class="pd-pin-action">↓</span></div>
            <div class="pd-pin tall"><img src="/images/home/fashion-board-reference-320.webp" srcset="/images/home/fashion-board-reference-320.webp 320w, /images/home/fashion-board-reference-640.webp 640w" sizes="110px" alt="" width="320" height="213" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><span class="pd-pin-action">↓</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="pd-panel">
          <div class="pd-entry">
            <div class="pd-web-card"><span class="pd-web-icon">←</span><span class="pd-web-copy"><b>选择图片或视频</b><small>点击页面上的图片或视频</small></span><span class="pd-web-go">◎</span></div>
            <div class="pd-web-card"><span class="pd-web-icon">▦</span><span class="pd-web-copy"><b>查找此页面上的所有图片</b><small>扫描页面、框架和延迟加载图片</small></span><span class="pd-web-go">→</span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="pd-bulk">
            <div class="pd-bulk-head"><button class="pd-bulk-btn" type="button" tabindex="-1">←</button><div class="pd-bulk-title"><b>页面中的图片</b><small>找到 24 张图片</small></div><button class="pd-bulk-btn" type="button" tabindex="-1">↻</button><button class="pd-bulk-btn" type="button" tabindex="-1">≡</button></div>
            <div class="pd-bulk-actions"><span>全选</span><span>清除</span><span>已选择 6 张</span></div>
            <div class="pd-bulk-grid">
              <div class="pd-bulk-card"><img src="/images/home/fashion-reference-320.webp" alt="" width="320" height="443" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><span class="pd-tick">✓</span></div>
              <div class="pd-bulk-card"><img src="/images/home/travel-reference-320.webp" alt="" width="320" height="213" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><span class="pd-tick">✓</span></div>
              <div class="pd-bulk-card"><img src="/images/home/workspace-reference-320.webp" alt="" width="320" height="214" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><span class="pd-tick">✓</span></div>
              <div class="pd-bulk-card"><img src="/images/home/fashion-board-reference-320.webp" alt="" width="320" height="213" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><span class="pd-tick">✓</span></div>
              <div class="pd-bulk-card"><img src="/images/home/fashion-reference-320.webp" alt="" width="320" height="443" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><span class="pd-tick">✓</span></div>
              <div class="pd-bulk-card"><img src="/images/home/travel-reference-320.webp" alt="" width="320" height="213" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><span class="pd-tick">✓</span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="pd-download-bar">
              <div class="pd-download-row"><div class="pd-save"><label>保存为</label><select class="pd-select" tabindex="-1"><option>原始格式</option></select></div><div class="pd-download-split"><button class="pd-download-main" type="button" tabindex="-1">下载</button><button class="pd-download-more" type="button" tabindex="-1">⌄</button></div></div>
              <div class="pd-download-meta">下载到文件夹 · 创建 ZIP</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="extension-product-copy">
    <div class="extension-product-top"><div class="extension-product-name">Pinterest 下载</div><span class="extension-live">Chrome</span></div>
    <p>直接从当前 Pinterest 页面下载视频、图片和 GIF。可以只选一个文件，也可以扫描页面、批量选择多个结果并分别保存或打包为 ZIP。</p>
    <div class="extension-features"><span class="extension-feature">选择单个文件</span><span class="extension-feature">扫描页面</span><span class="extension-feature">批量选择</span><span class="extension-feature">原始文件</span><span class="extension-feature">ZIP</span></div>
    <div class="extension-actions">
      <a class="extension-btn primary" href="https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/pinterest-downloader/nmpahchhmcdejmfcmkphnbhckmlhhnon?utm_source=layerporter&amp;utm_medium=website&amp;utm_campaign=extensions_hub_zh-cn" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">添加到 Chrome ↗</a>
      <a class="extension-btn secondary" href="/zh-cn/pinterest-downloader/">查看详情 →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</article>

<article class="extension-product">
  <div class="extension-product-visual converter" aria-label="图片转换器">
    <div class="ux-window">
      <div class="ux-window-head"><div class="ux-dots" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><div class="ux-url">example.com / product-image.webp</div><div class="ux-extension-icon"><img src="/picture-converter/welcome/picture-converter-icon.png" alt="" width="21" height="21" decoding="async" /></div></div>
      <div class="pc-workspace">
        <div class="pc-source-card"><span class="pc-source-arrow">←</span><span class="pc-source-copy"><b>从网站选择图片</b><small>从当前页面导入图片</small></span><span class="pc-source-icon"><img src="/picture-converter/welcome/picture-converter-icon.png" alt="" width="25" height="25" decoding="async" /></span></div>
        <div class="pc-main">
          <div class="pc-stage"><div class="pc-gallery-icon">▧</div><strong>将图片拖放到这里</strong><p>或从电脑选择文件</p><button class="pc-choose" type="button" tabindex="-1">选择图片</button><div class="pc-formats-title">支持的输入格式</div><div class="pc-inputs"><span>PNG</span><span>JPG</span><span>WebP</span><span>HEIC</span><span>AVIF</span><span>GIF</span><span>BMP</span><span>JFIF</span><span>SVG</span><span>+1</span></div></div>
          <div class="pc-settings">
            <div class="pc-output-formats"><span class="pc-format active">PNG ✓</span><span class="pc-format">JPG</span><span class="pc-format">WEBP</span><span class="pc-format">PDF</span><span class="pc-format">ICO</span></div>
            <div class="pc-option"><div class="pc-option-row"><span>质量</span><span>92%</span></div><div class="pc-range"></div></div>
            <button class="pc-download" type="button" tabindex="-1">↓ 下载 PNG</button>
            <div class="pc-summary"><b>输入</b> WebP · 1600×1200<br /><b>输出</b> PNG · 1600×1200</div>
            <div class="pc-local">本地处理，不会上传任何文件。</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="extension-product-copy">
    <div class="extension-product-top"><div class="extension-product-name">图片转换器</div><span class="extension-live">Chrome</span></div>
    <p>从网站选择图片或打开本地文件，然后保存为 PNG、JPG、WebP、PDF 或 ICO。本地文件会在您的设备上处理。</p>
    <div class="extension-features"><span class="extension-feature">来自网站</span><span class="extension-feature">来自电脑</span><span class="extension-feature">PNG / JPG / WebP</span><span class="extension-feature">PDF / ICO</span><span class="extension-feature">本地处理</span></div>
    <div class="extension-actions">
      <a class="extension-btn primary" href="https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/picture-converter/oegpbmdpckfdgodnkdnoggedamfflfcl?utm_source=layerporter&amp;utm_medium=website&amp;utm_campaign=extensions_hub_zh-cn" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">添加到 Chrome ↗</a>
      <a class="extension-btn secondary" href="/zh-cn/picture-converter/">查看详情 →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</article>
</section>
<p class="extensions-note">每个扩展程序都有独立页面，介绍完整功能和使用流程。</p>
</div>
</main>
<footer class="site-footer"><div class="wrap"><p>LayerPorter — 浏览器扩展程序和在线工具</p><nav class="footer-nav" aria-label="Footer"><a href="/about/">关于</a><span>·</span><a href="/zh-cn/extensions/">扩展程序</a><span>·</span><a href="/privacy/">隐私</a><span>·</span><a href="/terms/">条款</a></nav></div></footer>
</body>
</html>